@page "/faqs"

<PageTitle>FAQs | Bored But Broke</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/faqs.css" />
</HeadContent>

<div class="page-content">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

    <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is Bored But Broke free to use?</summary>
            <p>Yes, completely free. No sign-up. No hidden fees or subscription.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How does the weather affect my day plan?</summary>
            <p>We check the weather forecast for the date and times you choose. If rain, snow or storms are expected for 40% or more of that time, we'll only suggest indoor options like galleries, cafes, and comedy clubs. Otherwise, you'll see a mix of indoor and outdoor activities.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is the budget selection exactly?</summary>
            <p>It's the rough amount you're happy to spend per person. This covers entry fees or food cost</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can I use this for a family trip with young children?</summary>
            <p>Yes. Choose the "Family with Kids" option and we'll filter suggestions to make sure they're child-friendly, with suitable facilities and age-appropriate activities.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How accurate is the location data?</summary>
            <p>We use Yelp and Geoapify APIs which have comprehensive coverage across the UK and beyond. Results work best in towns and cities, but very rural areas may have fewer suggestions available.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What if I don't like the suggestions?</summary>
            <p>Just run a new search. You can tweak your budget, categories, or location and get a fresh set of recommendations each time.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What if I want to go out late and nowhere is open?</summary>
            <p>We display the opening and closing hours of every place we recommend, so you have nothing to worry about. You can always check the link provided to the website if you still have any doubts.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Do you store my data?</summary>
            <p>Only if you sign up. We store your name, email address and a hashed password, plus the places you save to your favourites. You don't need an account to search, and we don't save your searches or location.</p>
        </details>
    </div>
</div>